&_nc_oc=Adp2l-sFOqvOYgXe8_P8Shy5PWTGF-1dUomhdHZ6o8LMwcho5I6Ar9C-ebYAHKe1QGo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEt0Mx3JI3V6No9JL_eXDvV9Jw4jhSAxfXbtw7uu0VuaA&oe=6A88337E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N8ZvmcIfShEQ7kNvwF3fzm3&_nc_oc=AdrFzN9vUuvvyZNy96axl2c5sEDqwou05bVW5BOuamerdFLM3daYE2yRr-MstS2OJcM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG5evi5Ls4gbk0brviLWIPTzL9dCXKfU-D93b4o5iI8QQ&oe=6A88447C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QPjULVfUEPgQ7kNvwF7lojL&_nc_oc=AdqVd1wPt-cVEgwNbj9zLfdEO5FUcvFqC9H92t6iBjZw1sdKHxYg_4qsh8qP5nXiHJw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQElAYJeCZjW_l7iGHvMrOO3xJVXFRv_LTCnsY0U0Sljww&oe=6A882AC7"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q3uSd0r9OIIQ7kNvwHShilv&_nc_oc=AdoAnXqevMRcbxeGKPyTOdPWTYuXzcGWcX6o9ArqNbgPS8hGaUyVkuujLyCUgRY9DVo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH9BylsHGiMkDugYJBD2X6a-S7l2u5Z_rZt9MypczuYlw&oe=6A884ED5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1bgAko4VXGQQ7kNvwEYvvkh&_nc_oc=Adp3aAFbmF9X9DBzmt62Y-L79Sdk1n3WroPfbsVSkJIoGYBk2HHDFSOMgoqeD8mHxtM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGLmjh906OPz7JZ_NYWDs2Xjj5xUCJXjgZr0JK08kPnNQ&oe=6A882324"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.